BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gail Daughtry and the Celebrity Sex Pass
DTSTART:20260710T020000Z
DTEND:20260710T035000Z
DTSTAMP:20260710T020000Z
UID:mbtNoZKbHu
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nMidwestern bride-to-be Gail Daugh
 try has a “free celebrity pass” agreement with her fiancé — who use
 s it. With her relationship in crisis\, Gail sets out on an epic journey t
 hrough Hollywood to even the scales.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-the
 aters/gail-daughtry-and-the-celebrity-sex-pass\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
